  "img": "icons/svg/book.svg",
  "system": {
    "identifier": "breath-of-wind-claws",
    "description": "<p>You begin to collect wind release chakra until it spirals around the user’s weapon creating whipping torrents of wind. You lift your weapon upwards towards the right, above your head and unleashes four vertical strikes at once down on the enemy resembling claws.</p>\n<p>Make four melee taijutsu attacks against a single creature, record the number of successful hits. If you score at least one attack, you deal your [Weapons damage] +1d8 wind damage. For every attack that hits, beyond the first, you deal an additional 1d8 wind damage. If you roll a critical hit on any of these attacks, you increase the wind damage by 2d8.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creature must make a Strength saving throw, being thrown 20 feet in a direction of your choice (excluding up), on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: Affected creature must make a Dexterity saving throw, gaining 2 ranks of Bleed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above  C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the number of attacks you can make by +1. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank or higher, Swirl. Affected creature spreads all Elemental conditions currently affecting them around to all creatures, excluding yourself within 5 feet. Hostile creatures within 5 feet the target gains 1 rank of all Elemental conditions currently affecting it.</p>",
